<deadlockability name="Splatter" />

'''Splatter''' is Viscous's first signature ability — a thrown ball of goo that deals spirit damage on impact and leaves lingering puddles that slow enemies standing in them.

== How to use it ==
* Your main early-game wave-clear and poke tool: the goo puddles let you contest last-hits and zone melee-range enemies.
* The slow sets up [[Puddle Punch]] and makes follow-up gunfire much easier to land.
* At tier&nbsp;3 the ball '''bounces''', so a single cast can cover a lane or catch enemies around a corner.

== Recommended items ==
Spirit power, cooldown, and radius extend Splatter's damage and zoning:
<deadlockitemrow items="Mystic Burst, Mystic Expansion, Improved Spirit, Escalating Exposure, Torment Pulse, Superior Cooldown" />

